    "created_at": "2019-07-11T10:03:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-07-12T02:10:29Z",
    "body": "Is there any rule of connection priority?  As far as I understand, it's not clear `[Clamp] long?` should be interpreted as `[Clamp] (long?)` or `([Clamp] long)?`.\r\nIDL grammar defines it in `[Clamp] (long?)` format, but I think its interpretation does not need to follow the same rule with its grammar.",
