    "updated_at": "2019-07-11T13:56:36Z",
    "body": "Right, that is exactly what this issue is about.  Per grammar, you end up with `[Clamp] (long?)` which as currently defined is an error.  It may make more sense to treat that case as valid and apply the clamping to the `long` in that situation, but it needs spec changes to accomplish that.",
